,"examples":[{"text":"C'est difficile de communiquer.","en":"It's hard to communicate.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"difficult"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"L'anglais est un moyen de communiquer.","en":"English is a means of communication.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"English"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"method, way of doing"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Les pilotes communiquent par radio avec l'aéroport.","en":"Pilots communicate with the airport by radio.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"pilot","l":"pilote"},null,{"g":"through"},{"g":"radio, tuner"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"airport"}]},{"text":"J'ai un message que je veux que tu communiques.","en":"I have a message I want you to deliver.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"message"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Ils peuvent communiquer en faisant des signes avec les mains.","en":"They can communicate using hand signs.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"sign (indicator","l":"signe"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"hand","l":"main"}]}]}